profanity-ko-en

Data sources and licenses:

(a) Korean pattern data (single-char normalization map, multi-char
    replacements, category pattern lists, false-positive lists) derived
    from https://github.com/Tanat05/korcen by Tanat05, MIT License.
    Modifications applied: fixed a source missing-comma bug ('ㅈㅗ118'
    split back into two entries), deduplicated entries, added
    normalization-closure variants, added original patterns
    ('씨발','시ㅏ발','ㅅㅏ발','sl발') and an original English
    leet map.

(b) English word list derived from the `en` list of
    https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words,
    licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/),
    with the addition of 'balls' (original to this project).

(c) Engine implementation and all other files are original to this
    project, MIT License.
